C 19 Dexterity saving throw, taking 66 (12d10) lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Repulsion Breath — exhales repulsion energy in a 30-foot cone; each creature in that area must succeed on a DC 19 Strength saving throw or be pushed 60 feet away from Runara."},{"name":"Change Shape","text":"Runara magically transforms into a Humanoid or Beast that is Medium or Small, while retaining her game statistics (other than her size). This transformation ends if Runara is reduced to 0 hit points or uses a bonus action to end it."}]}');
INSERT INTO sections (id, chapter, heading, heading_path, "order", type, dm_only_text, read_aloud_text) VALUES ('creature-spore-servant-octopus', 'Appendix B: Creatures', 'Spore Servant Octopus', '["Creature Descriptions"]', 100013, 'creature', 'Spore Servant Octopus — Large Plant, Unaligned.
AC 11, HP 52 (8d10 + 8), Speed walk 5 ft., swim 50 ft..
Abilities: STR 17 (+3), DEX 13 (+1), CON 13 (+1), INT 2 (-4), WIS 13 (+1), CHA 1 (-5).
Immunities: Blinded, Charmed, Frightened, Paralyzed.
Senses: Blindsight 30 ft. (blind beyond this radius), Passive Perception 8.
Languages: —.
Challenge: 1 (XP 200, PB +2).
Hold Breath: While out of water, the octopus can hold its breath for 1 hour.
Water Breathing: The octopus can breathe only underwater.
Tentacles: Melee Weapon Attack: +5 to hit, reach 15 ft., one target. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) bludgeoning damage.', '');
INSERT INTO creature_stats (section_id, stat_block_json) VALUES ('creature-spore-servant-octopus', '{"name":"Spore Servant Octopus","source":"DoSI p46","size":"Large","type":"Plant","alignment":"Unaligned","ac":11,"init":1,"hp_avg":52,"hp_formula":"8d10 + 8","speed":{"walk":5,"swim":50},"cr":"1","xp":200,"pb":2,"abilities":{"str":{"score":17,"mod":3,"save":3},"dex":{"score":13,"mod":1,"save":1},"con":{"score":13,"mod":1,"save":1},"int":{"score":2,"mod":-4,"save":-4},"wis":{"score":13,"mod":1,"save":1},"cha":{"score":1,"mod":-5,"save":-5}},"skills":{},"immunities":["Blinded","Charmed","Frightened","Paralyzed"],"senses":"Blindsight 30 ft. (blind beyond this radius), Passive Perception 8","languages":"—","traits":[{"name":"Hold Breath","text":"While out of water, the octopus can hold its breath for 1 hour."},{"name":"Water Breathing","text":"The octopus can breathe only underwater."}],"actions":[{"name":"Tentacles","text":"Melee Weapon Attack: +5 to hit, reach 15 ft., one target. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) bludgeoning damage."}]}');
INSERT INTO sections (id, chapter, heading, heading_path, "order", type, dm_only_text, read_aloud_text) VALUES ('creature-stirge', 'Appendix B: Creatures', 'Stirge', '["Creature Descriptions"]', 100014, 'creature', 'Stirge — Tiny Monstrosity, Unaligned.
AC 13, HP 5 (2d4), Speed walk 10 ft., fly 40 ft..
Abilities: STR 4 (-3), DEX 16 (+3), CON 11 (+0), INT 2 (-4), WIS 8 (-1), CHA 6 (-2).
Senses: Darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 9.
Languages: —.
Challenge: 1/8 (XP 25, PB +2).
Proboscis: Melee Attack Roll +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Piercing damage, and the stirge attaches to the target. While attached, the stirge can''t make Proboscis attacks, and the target takes 5 (2d4) Necrotic damage at the start of each of the stirge''s turns. The stirge can detach itself by spending 5 feet of its movement. The target or a creature within 5 feet of it can detach the stirge as an action.', '');
INSERT INTO creature_stats (section_id, stat_block_json) VALUES ('creature-stirge', '{"name":"Stirge","source":"MM''25 p299","size":"Tiny","type":"Monstrosity","alignment":"Unaligned","ac":13,"init":3,"hp_avg":5,"hp_formula":"2d4","speed":{"walk":10,"fly":40},"cr":"1/8","xp":25,"pb":2,"abilities":{"str":{"score":4,"mod":-3,"save":-3},"dex":{"score":16,"mod":3,"save":3},"con":{"score":11,"mod":0,"save":0},"int":{"score":2,"mod":-4,"save":-4},"wis":{"score":8,"mod":-1,"save":-1},"cha":{"score":6,"mod":-2,"save":-2}},"skills":{},"senses":"Darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 9","languages":"—","traits":[],"actions":[{"name":"Proboscis","text":"Melee Attack Roll +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Piercing damage, and the stirge attaches to the target. While attached, the stirge can''t make Proboscis attacks, and the target takes 5 (2d4) Necrotic damage at the start of each of the stirge''s turns. The stirge can detach itself by spending 5 feet of its movement. The target or a creature within 5 feet of it can detach the stirge as an action."}]}');
INSERT INTO sections (id, chapter, heading, heading_path, "order", type, dm_only_text, read_aloud_text) VALUES ('creature-tarak', 'Appendix B: Creatures', 'Tarak', '["Creature Descriptions"]', 100015, 'creature', 'Tarak — Medium Humanoid (Human), Lawful Neutral.
AC 13, HP 27 (6d8), Speed walk 30 ft..
Abilities: STR 10 (+0), DEX 16 (+3), CON 10 (+0), INT 12 (+1), WIS 14 (+2), CHA 16 (+3).
Skills: Deception +5, Insight +4, Medicine +4, Nature +3.
Senses: Passive Perception 12.
Languages: Common, Draconic, Thieves'' cant.
Challenge: 1 (XP 200, PB +2).
Multiattack: Tarak makes three Dagger attacks.
Dagger: Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 5 (1d4 + 3) piercing damage.
Cunning Action (Bonus Action): Tarak takes the Dash, Disengage, or Hide action.', '');
